        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/ce0b43155fc78a2b90b9b672f672ca69.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/ce0b43155fc78a2b90b9b672f672ca69.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/ce0b43155fc78a2b90b9b672f672ca69.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tring! is a score-attack game where you fly a triangle shaped spaceship and bounce your shot balls off walls. Every third bounce off your ball counts towards one point and destroying a golden square is another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/4dff5da91f6780dbddb86dfc90177337.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/4dff5da91f6780dbddb86dfc90177337.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/4dff5da91f6780dbddb86dfc90177337.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every three levels you get a chance to select an upgrade. What will you choose? Speed, more bullets or one more turn to play?<br><br>Or catch a power-up and go into bullet time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/95d139a42d68def2e3b5992e69a01efb.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/95d139a42d68def2e3b5992e69a01efb.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/95d139a42d68def2e3b5992e69a01efb.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In bullet time time slows down and only moves when you move!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/87117dc700a0b452563cbabd3016719f.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/87117dc700a0b452563cbabd3016719f.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/87117dc700a0b452563cbabd3016719f.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and play together with them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/47dc7e123b88f324d7d39e275bd8fa78.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/47dc7e123b88f324d7d39e275bd8fa78.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/47dc7e123b88f324d7d39e275bd8fa78.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/ce0b43155fc78a2b90b9b672f672ca69.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/ce0b43155fc78a2b90b9b672f672ca69.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/ce0b43155fc78a2b90b9b672f672ca69.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tring! is a score-attack game where you fly a triangle shaped spaceship and bounce your shot balls off walls. Every third bounce off your ball counts towards one point and destroying a golden square is another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/4dff5da91f6780dbddb86dfc90177337.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/4dff5da91f6780dbddb86dfc90177337.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/4dff5da91f6780dbddb86dfc90177337.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every three levels you get a chance to select an upgrade. What will you choose? Speed, more bullets or one more turn to play?<br><br>Or catch a power-up and go into bullet time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/95d139a42d68def2e3b5992e69a01efb.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/95d139a42d68def2e3b5992e69a01efb.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/95d139a42d68def2e3b5992e69a01efb.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In bullet time time slows down and only moves when you move!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/87117dc700a0b452563cbabd3016719f.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/87117dc700a0b452563cbabd3016719f.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/87117dc700a0b452563cbabd3016719f.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and play together with them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/47dc7e123b88f324d7d39e275bd8fa78.poster.avif?t=1753628966\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/47dc7e123b88f324d7d39e275bd8fa78.webm?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/47dc7e123b88f324d7d39e275bd8fa78.mp4?t=1753628966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
